    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every parcel worth ₹20,000 or more must carry an e‑Way bill issued by the GST portal. This electronic document authorises the transport of goods, provides a digital trail for customs and tax authorities, and ensures you avoid penalties.</p>
