    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Institute of Business Administration (IBA) certifies Lorry Receipts that detail the cargo, route, and weight. An LR/Bilty from a reputable packers and movers in Kochi guarantees that the carrier has recorded the goods correctly, simplifying dispute resolution if damage occurs.</p>
